      "id": "P03",
      "topic": "AI与工具",
      "text": "MarkItDown 的 OCR 插件有个容易忽略的细节：没配置模型客户端，插件照样加载，但 OCR 会跳过。\n\n“生成了文件”不等于“内容提取完整”。试转换工具时，放一页扫描件进去，再对照原文检查。\n\nhttps://github.com/microsoft/markitdown/blob/main/packages/markitdown-ocr/README.md",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown/blob/main/packages/markitdown-ocr/README.md",
      "source_rechecked_at": "2026-09-30T16:15:06Z",
